<title>USA: U.S. June S&amp;P 500s crumble to fresh session lows.</title>
<headline>U.S. June S&amp;P 500s crumble to fresh session lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>March 31 - U.S. June S&amp;P 500 futures fell to fresh session lows -- down 15.00 full points on the day -- in a continued selloff once T-bond futures closed. June at the lowest price since Jan 10. Support now at 760.00 and the Jan 10 low of 754.00.</p>
<p>--Chicago Derivative Desk (312) 408-8750</p>
